+ * shaders use a set to which nothing was bound at that bind point since the begin, which
+ * Vulkan does not allow (VUID-vkCmdDraw-None-08600 and the same for every draw and
+ * dispatch; "use" here is narrower than Vulkan's static use: only a reached function's
+ * use, so vkr refuses less, never more), and an indexed draw without an index buffer
+ * unless maintenance6 is on (-None-07312). With maintenance6 such a draw is legal: vkr
+ * binds the NULL index buffer for it, as the app could (MoltenVK takes that). A set bound
